Oh. L... Sorry.
I didn't think you'd be awake.


00:02:26.332 --> 00:02:27.492
You have an appointment...


00:02:27.667 --> 00:02:30.261
...with Guy Morgan,
I didn't think you'd wanna be late.


00:02:30.436 --> 00:02:33.371
Oh, look at you thinking. Cute.


00:02:33.539 --> 00:02:35.598
But I always have time for my portrait.


00:02:35.775 --> 00:02:37.299
Look alive. Paint.


00:02:37.743 --> 00:02:39.574
I'm feeling spiritually blocked.


00:02:39.745 --> 00:02:41.576
