Guy Morgan.


00:06:58.938 --> 00:07:00.769
Could you give his son, Luke, a tour?


00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:03.807
Sure. Would you like
to see the Wellesley perks?


00:07:03.976 --> 00:07:06.604
Um, yes, brilliant. Sure.


00:07:07.580 --> 00:07:09.070
- Katie.
I love your accent.


00:07:09.248 --> 00:07:10.840
Katie.
Wanna come over tonight?


00:07:11.016 --> 00:07:13.382
What are you still doing here? Go.


00:07:13.552 --> 00:07:16.953
