00:08:41.373 --> 00:08:44.831
Hold on, hold up. Please hold on.
My boy does not want your demos yet.


00:08:45.010 --> 00:08:47.274
Walk away. Move along. Bye.


00:08:47.446 --> 00:08:50.813
It was nice chatting
or whatever that was.


00:08:51.083 --> 00:08:53.415
- Yes, hi, I'm, uh...
- Luke Morgan, right?


00:08:53.586 --> 00:08:55.110
