is mad, mad drama, okay?


00:09:54.446 --> 00:09:56.846
I am talking to you
and you don't even know my name.


00:09:57.016 --> 00:09:58.916
- I'm Mickey O'Malley.
- Mickey O'Malley.


00:09:59.084 --> 00:10:00.711
A rarity in the Irish community.


00:10:01.287 --> 00:10:03.380
Om.


00:10:04.189 --> 00:10:06.817
RAVl: Om.
- Om.


00:10:06.992 --> 00:10:09.085
- Om.
- Om!


00:10:09.261 --> 00:10:11.786
This is not a contest, Ms. Gail.


00:10:12.164 --> 00:10:13.791
Just concentrate on your breathing.


00:10:15.301 --> 00:10:16.461
My butt is numb.


00:10:16.802 --> 00:10:19.999
If your butt is suffering,
then you are suffering.


00:10:20.172 --> 00:10:23.630
In fact, your entire life is suffering. Why?


00:10:23.809 --> 00:10:26.903
Because you crave
that which is meaningless.


00:10:27.079 --> 00:10:29.070
Are you calling me shallow?


00:10:30.149 --> 00:10:35.985
No, I'm saying to stop your craving
and release your butt.


00:10:36.155 --> 00:10:39.716
Just release it. Release it, yeah.
Release that butt.


00:10:40.592 --> 00:10:43.652
<i>Release that butt
Oh, yeah, release that butt</i>


00:10:43.829 --> 00:10:46.423
<i>Oh, yeah, release that butt</i>


00:10:46.598 --> 00:10:47.895
Mrs. Van Ravensway?


00:10:48.067 --> 00:10:50.592
