00:11:53.465 --> 00:11:54.489
<i>Ow.</i>


00:11:54.666 --> 00:11:57.100
<i>What are you doing?
I'm on the phone.</i>


00:11:57.269 --> 00:11:58.861
<i>- I'm cleansing.
Heh, heh.</i>


00:11:59.071 --> 00:12:01.301
Mac and cheese.


00:12:02.207 --> 00:12:05.335
<i>I don't need your spiritual counseling.</i>


00:12:05.878 --> 00:12:07.436
<i>I'm thinking of firing you.</i>


00:12:12.951 --> 00:12:16.318
Pace yourself, Ms. Gail,
or you will not be one with everything.


00:12:16.488 --> 00:12:19.821
Honey, that's what I got you for.
Now, make me one with everything.


00:12:21.226 --> 00:12:24.423
