- Now.


01:10:09.943 --> 01:10:11.968
This way, please, come on.


01:10:12.145 --> 01:10:14.204
What a lovely suit.


01:10:18.785 --> 01:10:19.877
Move it.


01:10:20.053 --> 01:10:22.453
Hey. Out of the way. Out of the way.
Michael, go on.


01:10:22.622 --> 01:10:24.886
I have to announce what's next.
I'll see you at the end.


01:10:25.058 --> 01:10:26.923
Guy. Tom. Tom.


01:10:27.560 --> 01:10:28.959
I'll be right back.


01:10:31.497 --> 01:10:32.759
Good to see you.


01:10:32.932 --> 01:10:34.797
Nice suit.


01:10:41.641 --> 01:10:45.577
What was that back there?
This is your last chance to get it right.


01:10:45.745 --> 01:10:48.714
Unless you wanna see
Angela's Juilliard dreams go bye-bye.


01:10:48.881 --> 01:10:52.840
That what you wanna be? A little
dwarfish Asian girl's dream crusher, huh?


01:10:53.019 --> 01:10:54.043
- Do you?
- No. No.


01:10:54.220 --> 01:10:57.087
No? No? No? Then focus!


01:11:02.595 --> 01:11:05.257
- Look, Ange, you...
- Gail's been threatening me too.


01:11:05.431 --> 01:11:07.456
That's why you're doing
what she wants.


01:11:07.800 --> 01:11:10.098
