- Ange.


01:11:10.703 --> 01:11:12.637
You're my best friend.


01:11:12.805 --> 01:11:15.239
Look, I'd do anything for you.


01:11:25.718 --> 01:11:27.549
Okay.


01:11:29.789 --> 01:11:34.317
So we're gonna take it up a notch
with Jason Berkeley and the Funky Funk.


01:11:40.166 --> 01:11:41.190
Scratch that.


01:11:41.367 --> 01:11:44.302
Um, here are my boys, the Oral Majority.


01:11:53.012 --> 01:11:55.480
<i>I'm lost in a world that rattles my brain</i>


01:11:55.648 --> 01:11:59.550
<i>Cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:12:02.355 --> 01:12:03.720
Move it. Guy.


01:12:03.890 --> 01:12:08.088
This is just the boring appetizer.
The real showstopper's up next.


01:12:08.261 --> 01:12:09.728
Ah!
Oh!


01:12:09.896 --> 01:12:12.763
You okay, Mr. Morgan?
Here, let me get that for you.


01:12:14.200 --> 01:12:15.394
Well, it had better be.


01:12:15.568 --> 01:12:16.796
I have to pee.


01:12:16.969 --> 01:12:20.200
Oh, I will take you to the pee, Mr. Victor.


01:12:23.142 --> 01:12:24.973
Sorry.


01:12:25.411 --> 01:12:27.936
<i>So keep on knocking, knocking, knocking</i>


01:12:28.114 --> 01:12:33.051
<i>But, baby, you're better off walking
'Cause I ain't gonna let you in</i>


01:12:33.786 --> 01:12:35.947
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:36.122 --> 01:12:39.182
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:39.358 --> 01:12:41.724
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:41.894 --> 01:12:45.227
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:50.036 --> 01:12:51.367
My brothers, yeah!


01:12:51.537 --> 01:12:52.936
Okay.


01:12:53.272 --> 01:12:55.433
You guys having a good time?


01:12:56.008 --> 01:13:00.411
Let's keep it going
with Beverly Van Ravensway.


01:13:12.525 --> 01:13:14.755
<i>Plug in the mike</i>


01:13:14.927 --> 01:13:16.224
<i>Open the curtain</i>


01:13:16.395 --> 01:13:17.760
<i>Turn on the lights</i>


01:13:18.564 --> 01:13:19.997
<i>I'm through rehearsing</i>


01:13:20.166 --> 01:13:22.259
<i>The feeling ignites</i>


01:13:22.435 --> 01:13:23.493
<i>I'm in control</i>


01:13:23.669 --> 01:13:27.765
<i>The crowd's in the palm of my hand
All my fans stand</i>


01:13:27.940 --> 01:13:31.376
<i>What is the truth?
What's an illusion?</i>


01:13:31.544 --> 01:13:35.241
<i>You're searching for proof
But are you certain?</i>


01:13:35.414 --> 01:13:38.975
<i>Whatever you see is what you get</i>


01:13:39.152 --> 01:13:42.952
<i>If words paint a picture
Then I bet you I can get you, yeah</i>


01:13:43.122 --> 01:13:47.354
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:13:47.527 --> 01:13:50.758
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:13:50.930 --> 01:13:54.366
<i>Tonight is the night
Where I'll make you see</i>


01:13:54.534 --> 01:13:58.231
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:13:58.404 --> 01:14:02.807
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:14:02.975 --> 01:14:04.442
<i>I can be what you want...</i>


01:14:08.314 --> 01:14:09.338
Give me...


01:14:16.022 --> 01:14:20.118
I'm so sorry, my mike...
My mike isn't working.


01:14:20.526 --> 01:14:23.017
Uh, excuse me.


01:14:25.898 --> 01:14:28.025
<i>I don't know.
- Give me that. Give me that.</i>


01:14:33.239 --> 01:14:37.471
How dare you sabotage your mother,
you rotten, rotten little boy?


01:14:37.643 --> 01:14:40.203
You, give me that. It doesn't matter.


01:14:40.379 --> 01:14:43.075
