01:14:55.328 --> 01:14:56.955
Stay.


01:15:01.434 --> 01:15:03.231
No, no, no. You gotta get out of here.


01:15:03.636 --> 01:15:06.935
You're about to sing for Bev.
Why are you about to sing for Bev?


01:15:07.874 --> 01:15:08.898
She can't sing.


01:15:15.348 --> 01:15:16.610
Come on.


01:15:16.782 --> 01:15:18.682
Hey. All of you, keep playing.


01:15:19.352 --> 01:15:21.149
Keep playing, you idiots.


01:15:21.320 --> 01:15:23.618
It was your voice the whole time?
Bev never sang at all?


01:15:25.224 --> 01:15:28.591
And she's about to not sing
for a whole bunch of people, so please...


01:15:28.761 --> 01:15:31.958
And on the dates, that... That was you.


01:15:36.402 --> 01:15:38.529
<i>I got nothing to lose</i>


01:15:39.038 --> 01:15:40.403
<i>I've been exposed</i>


01:15:40.573 --> 01:15:42.700
<i>I'm paying my dues</i>


01:15:42.875 --> 01:15:44.035
<i>Playing the role</i>


01:15:44.210 --> 01:15:46.576
<i>I'm breaking the rules</i>


01:15:46.746 --> 01:15:47.940
<i>Flow in the flow</i>


01:15:48.114 --> 01:15:52.073
<i>I got the whole world nodding, yes
Like some bobbleheads</i>


01:15:52.251 --> 01:15:53.616
<i>I'll break a sweat</i>


01:15:54.820 --> 01:15:55.844
<i>If you want it</i>


01:15:56.022 --> 01:15:58.149
<i>Confess all your sins</i>


01:15:58.324 --> 01:15:59.621
<i>You know you got 'em</i>


01:15:59.792 --> 01:16:02.056
<i>The room's in a spin</i>


01:16:02.228 --> 01:16:03.252
<i>The fever's pitched</i>


01:16:03.429 --> 01:16:05.397
- You gotta go. Come on, get out there.
Aah!


01:16:05.564 --> 01:16:07.361
<i>I'm legit, I'm no counterfeit</i>


01:16:07.533 --> 01:16:11.993
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:16:12.171 --> 01:16:14.935
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:16:15.107 --> 01:16:18.770
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:18.945 --> 01:16:22.574
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:16:22.748 --> 01:16:27.151
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:16:27.320 --> 01:16:28.514
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:16:28.688 --> 01:16:31.486
Hey! Shut that camera down! Now!


01:16:31.657 --> 01:16:34.125
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:34.293 --> 01:16:38.195
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:16:38.364 --> 01:16:40.457
<i>You want from me</i>


01:16:46.906 --> 01:16:48.703
That's what I'm talking about.


01:16:50.543 --> 01:16:53.034
Shut the power down. Shut it down.


01:16:56.182 --> 01:16:58.582
Not so fast, jerknuts.


01:17:01.887 --> 01:17:03.252
Hey. Clear.


01:17:06.359 --> 01:17:08.759
<i>Sing something else.
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:08.928 --> 01:17:10.225
Like what?


01:17:10.496 --> 01:17:12.361
The demo you snuck my dad. I heard it.


01:17:12.531 --> 01:17:14.328
Yeah, do it!
Do it!


01:17:14.500 --> 01:17:19.870
<i>We want more!
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:22.641 --> 01:17:24.609
Okay, follow my lead, guys.


01:17:32.318 --> 01:17:36.311
<i>There's a little secret
I would like to tell you</i>


01:17:39.425 --> 01:17:44.055
<i>There's a book of lies
I know they'll try to sell you</i>


01:17:45.297 --> 01:17:48.858
<i>And they'll try and they'll try
To convince you to buy</i>


01:17:49.035 --> 01:17:50.525
<i>You need them</i>


01:17:52.505 --> 01:17:55.941
<i>So the next time you're down
Look inside, not around</i>


01:17:56.108 --> 01:17:59.271
<i>I can dress myself</i>


01:17:59.445 --> 01:18:02.380
<i>There's no need for someone's help</i>


01:18:02.548 --> 01:18:04.175
<i>There's no one to blame</i>


01:18:04.350 --> 01:18:10.084
<i>There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:18:10.256 --> 01:18:13.555
<i>I can justify</i>


01:18:13.726 --> 01:18:16.695
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:18:16.862 --> 01:18:20.059
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:18:20.232 --> 01:18:22.632
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:18:22.802 --> 01:18:25.930
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:18:27.406 --> 01:18:34.278
<i>Do you ever wonder
How anything can make you cry?</i>


01:18:34.447 --> 01:18:38.110
<i>Have yourself discover</i>


01:18:38.284 --> 01:18:45.281
<i>That the pain you feel
Is the pain that you deny</i>


01:18:45.458 --> 01:18:48.723
<i>You can bless yourself</i>


01:18:48.894 --> 01:18:51.795
<i>There's no need for someone else</i>


01:18:51.964 --> 01:18:59.393
<i>There's no one to blame
There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:18:59.572 --> 01:19:02.769
<i>I can justify</i>


01:19:02.942 --> 01:19:05.911
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:19:06.078 --> 01:19:09.172
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:19:09.348 --> 01:19:11.839
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:19:12.017 --> 01:19:14.747
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:19:32.271 --> 01:19:33.932
Thank you, ladies and gentlemen.


01:19:34.106 --> 01:19:37.507
We hope you enjoyed the Wellesley
Academy of Arts Showcase.


01:19:37.676 --> 01:19:40.236
Oh, my God, you were so good.


01:19:40.613 --> 01:19:42.945
Who are you?
You're like a freaking rock star.


01:19:43.115 --> 01:19:45.208
Are you kidding me? Man, she likes you...


01:19:56.428 --> 01:19:59.363
So, what did he say? Is he mad?


01:19:59.532 --> 01:20:01.193
Yeah. He's pretty ticked off...


01:20:01.367 --> 01:20:05.133
...that I'm not already making
the next big album for Kensington Records.


01:20:07.106 --> 01:20:08.869
Oh. Which album?


01:20:09.775 --> 01:20:10.799
Your album.


01:20:12.478 --> 01:20:14.469
- Are you kidding me?
- No.


01:20:16.081 --> 01:20:18.549
- You're... You're serious?
- Uh-huh.


01:20:20.786 --> 01:20:22.117
Go for it.


01:20:22.288 --> 01:20:25.052
We're making an album.
And we're writing it together.


01:20:25.224 --> 01:20:27.283
Yeah! Yeah!
I'm so happy.


01:20:27.459 --> 01:20:29.256
You know, I sing too.


01:20:29.428 --> 01:20:33.057
I can do a whole monologue album.
Incredible. Hey, congratulations.


01:20:33.232 --> 01:20:37.760
- Yo, blow it up. Boom.
I'm your boy. Call me up.


01:20:37.937 --> 01:20:41.338
Yeah. Yeah, he's really good
at guitars. He's a kook.


01:20:56.055 --> 01:20:57.647
Guy! Wait!


01:20:57.823 --> 01:21:01.315
- What now, Gail? More lies?
- Well, everyone lies in this business.


01:21:01.493 --> 01:21:02.517
It's called spin.


01:21:03.162 --> 01:21:04.527
So Bev can't sing.


01:21:04.697 --> 01:21:06.426
That didn't stop Jessica Simpson.


01:21:06.599 --> 01:21:10.194
Well, we'll see what the school board
thinks when I get them a ring, shall we?


01:21:10.569 --> 01:21:13.367
