01:21:17.676 --> 01:21:19.143
Guy!


01:21:20.479 --> 01:21:24.142
I will have my nirvana moment.


01:21:24.383 --> 01:21:28.149
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:21:29.622 --> 01:21:32.682
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:21:32.858 --> 01:21:35.452
Oh, come on. Look alive, people.
I'm a star.


01:21:35.628 --> 01:21:37.186
Let's try this again.


01:21:37.396 --> 01:21:39.261
<i>I'll make you believe...</i>


01:21:40.833 --> 01:21:43.563
Oh, no. You want a piece of me?


01:22:09.228 --> 01:22:11.458
Hey. Clear.


01:22:27.146 --> 01:22:29.307
<i>Run this town tonight</i>


01:22:29.481 --> 01:22:31.847
Where's breakfast...? Sorry.


01:23:13.726 --> 01:23:16.320
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


01:23:16.495 --> 01:23:19.362
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:23:24.336 --> 01:23:27.863
- Katie, are you wearing a doormat?
- Welcome.


01:23:34.313 --> 01:23:36.372
Thanks. Now the pants.


01:23:41.553 --> 01:23:45.853
And then it would just take you somewhere
that you never expected you would go.


01:23:50.295 --> 01:23:53.287
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


01:23:53.465 --> 01:23:55.592
Oy, mate, oy.


01:24:15.087 --> 01:24:16.952
I love my life.


01:24:17.122 --> 01:24:19.317
<i>Call me.
- Hello?</i>


01:24:41.780 --> 01:24:44.977
<i>Yeah. You like it? You like it? Yeah.</i>

